title: "Code for: Shor's algorithm compiled on cat qubits: 22 593 qubits for RSA-2048 in 3.14 days"
abstract: >-
  Qualtran implementation of the logical approximate modular exponentiation oracle of
  Appendix B, and the script that regenerates its operation-count tables.
